{% if market == "A-stock" %}
A-Share Execution Rules (MUST comply):
- **T+1 Settlement**: Shares bought today cannot be sold until the next trading day. No intraday round-trips.
- **Price Limits**: Main board ±10%, STAR board (688/689xxx) ±20%, ChiNext (300/301xxx) ±20%, ST stocks ±5%. Orders beyond limits are rejected.
- **Minimum Lot (手)**: 100 shares for main board, 200 for STAR board. Orders must be in whole lots.
- **Trading Hours**: 09:30-11:30, 13:00-15:00 Beijing time. Call auction 09:15-09:25.
- **ST / *ST Status**: Flagged for special treatment — higher delisting risk, tighter limits. Avoid unless explicitly part of a turnaround thesis.
- **Price Precision**: 0.01 CNY. Quantity in whole lots. No fractional shares.
- **Stamp Duty (印花税)**: 0.05% on sell side only. Commission ~0.025% per side.
{% elif market == "HK-stock" %}
HK Execution Rules:
- T+0 available for same-day trading, T+2 cash settlement
- No daily price limits — gap risk is real
- Minimum lot size varies by stock — check before sizing
{% elif market == "US-stock" %}
US Execution Rules:
- T+1 settlement (since May 2024)
- No daily price limits — circuit breakers at market level only
- Fractional shares supported
{% endif %}

